        <part>
            08 90 00 00 FF FF FF FF 3B FE 80 80 80 00 01 02
            11 12 16 13 14 00 00 00 03 04 01 02 05 00 00 00
            0B 0C 09 0A 0D 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
